// Mission: Take ONE real user-facing workflow (a checkout, an onboarding form, a settings panel) and ship it end-to-end: semantic UI, every component state designed (loading, empty, error, disabled, success), keyboard-accessible, wired to a real API, and proven in a browser. Then package the proof as component_state_matrix_and_accessibility_packet.md.
